    "dateLine": "Feb 2026 - Feb 2026",
    "detailHtml": "<p><strong>AURA is an all-in-one productivity and intelligence app that helps users:</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Sync assignments and manage deadlines</li>\n            <li>Prioritize tasks and generate AI-based schedules</li>\n            <li>Chat with AI for study/work support</li>\n            <li>Organize documents, recordings, and transcripts into sections/subsections</li>\n            <li>Ask AI questions grounded in uploaded content</li>\n            <li>Get field-specific security/videos/news intel/events</li>\n            <li>Discover jobs and learning resources</li>\n            <li>Track productivity trends and wellness signals</li>\n            <li>Use a Chrome extension to capture web insights into the app</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"video-embed\">\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WDG4yBLh3To\" title=\"AURA (HackUNCP26) walkthrough\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"media-grid\">\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-10-analytics-keep-track-of-studnet-use-of-platforms-to-track-trends-and-out-of-ordinary-behavior-to-alert-you-about-possibility-of-fatigue.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 10 analytics keep track of studnet use of platforms to track trends and out of ordinary behavior to alert you about possibility of fatigue\"><figcaption>aura 10 analytics keep track of studnet use of platforms to track trends and out of ordinary behavior to alert you about possibility of fatigue</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-11-welness-tab-allows-students-to-set-timer-for-themselves-to-take-breaks-and-reminds-them-they-should-take-a-break-every-once-in-a-while.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 11 welness tab allows students to set timer for themselves to take breaks and reminds them they should take a break every once in a while\"><figcaption>aura 11 welness tab allows students to set timer for themselves to take breaks and reminds them they should take a break every once in a while</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-14-networking-and-connecting-students-prefessionals-page.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 14 networking and connecting students prefessionals page\"><figcaption>aura 14 networking and connecting students prefessionals page</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-2page-with-canvas-and-other-learning-management-integration-of-upcoming-tasks-update-and-ai-suggestion.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 2page with canvas and other learning management integration of upcoming tasks update and ai suggestion\"><figcaption>aura 2page with canvas and other learning management integration of upcoming tasks update and ai suggestion</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-3-page-that-gives-you-update-of-all-important-security-updates-in-your-field-and-important-news-as-well-as-cve-feed.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 3 page that gives you update of all important security updates in your field and important news as well as cve feed\"><figcaption>aura 3 page that gives you update of all important security updates in your field and important news as well as cve feed</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-4-ai-lab-it-analyze-meetings-videos-and-gives-you-and-overview-summery-tasklist-or-flashcard-and-gives-you-the-option-to-chat-about-it.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 4 ai lab it analyze meetings videos and gives you and overview summery tasklist or flashcard and gives you the option to chat about it\"><figcaption>aura 4 ai lab it analyze meetings videos and gives you and overview summery tasklist or flashcard and gives you the option to chat about it</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-5-ai-study-buddy-or-field-specific-question-chatbot-with-ability-to-upload-file.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 5 ai study buddy or field specific question chatbot with ability to upload file\"><figcaption>aura 5 ai study buddy or field specific question chatbot with ability to upload file</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-6-learning-feed-allows-students-to-look-for-educational-videos-on-youtube-through-the-app.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 6 learning feed allows students to look for educational videos on youtube through the app\"><figcaption>aura 6 learning feed allows students to look for educational videos on youtube through the app</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-7-event-tab-based-on-your-stem-field-it-pulls-data-on-the-nearest-events-related-to-your-field-and-shows-them-to-you-closest-first.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 7 event tab based on your stem field it pulls data on the nearest events related to your field and shows them to you closest first\"><figcaption>aura 7 event tab based on your stem field it pulls data on the nearest events related to your field and shows them to you closest first</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura-9-allows-you-to-create-folders-to-keep-your-data-organized-upload-materials-and-automatically-analyzes-for-information-and-keeps-it.jpeg\" alt=\"aura 9 allows you to create folders to keep your data organized upload materials and automatically analyzes for information and keeps it\"><figcaption>aura 9 allows you to create folders to keep your data organized upload materials and automatically analyzes for information and keeps it</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura1-main-page-with-overview-and-ability-to-listen-to-the-major-news-in-your-field-using-elvenlabs-like-a-podcast-and-add-tasks-to-your-day-plan.jpeg\" alt=\"aura1 main page with overview and ability to listen to the major news in your field using elvenlabs like a podcast and add tasks to your day plan\"><figcaption>aura1 main page with overview and ability to listen to the major news in your field using elvenlabs like a podcast and add tasks to your day plan</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura12-network-allows-students-professionals-to-reachout-to-other-professionals-and-filtered-by-distance.jpeg\" alt=\"aura12 network allows students professionals to reachout to other professionals and filtered by distance\"><figcaption>aura12 network allows students professionals to reachout to other professionals and filtered by distance</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura13-network-allows-students-professionals-to-reachout-to-other-professionals-and-filtered-by-distance.jpeg\" alt=\"aura13 network allows students professionals to reachout to other professionals and filtered by distance\"><figcaption>aura13 network allows students professionals to reachout to other professionals and filtered by distance</figcaption></figure>\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/aura/aura8-the-job-board-pulls-all-data-about-fulltime-parttime-jobs-and-internships-for-students-and-professionals.jpeg\" alt=\"aura8 the job board pulls all data about fulltime parttime jobs and internships for students and professionals\"><figcaption>aura8 the job board pulls all data about fulltime parttime jobs and internships for students and professionals</figcaption></figure>\n          </div>",
