      "Endpoint Risk"
    ],
    "dateLine": "Dec 2025 - Jan 2026",
    "detailHtml": "<p>Developed a proof-of-concept background keylogger for cybersecurity research and demonstration.</p>\n          <p>The system can be deployed via USB, runs in the background, captures keystrokes, stores logs locally, and transmits encrypted reports via scheduled email.</p>\n          <p>Purpose: demonstrate endpoint security risk, persistence techniques, and exfiltration behavior to support detection and mitigation understanding.</p>",
