    "detailHtml": "<p>Team designed QuickVest for Fidelity with focus on accessibility, trust, and usability, reducing onboarding friction for new investors.</p>\n          <p>Color/contrast choices prioritized visual comfort and inclusion for color-vision accessibility.</p>\n          <p>Main technical challenge: Figma lacks native external AI integration (Gemini) and existing widgets were insufficient.</p>\n          <p>Built a custom widget from scratch for Gemini integration in Figma (Edit Mode only; Figma limitation in Presenter View).</p>\n          <p>Widget is the only black-box AI part; all other flows/pages/designs were built by the team.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"media-grid\">\n            <figure class=\"media-item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"./assets/media/projects/quickvest/quickvestapp-first5-page.jpeg\" alt=\"quickvestapp first5 page\"><figcaption>quickvestapp first5 page</figcaption></figure>\n          </div>",
